        "generation_context_sources": [
          {
            "id": "WAR-1",
            "text": "## [WAR-1] Brand warranty\nMost electronics come with the manufacturer's warranty. The warranty period is listed in the `warranty_months` column of the product catalog. Brand warranty claims are made with the manufacturer's service centre.",
            "file": "pol_warranty_assured.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-02-01",
            "version": "1.1",
            "title": "Brand warranty"
          },
          {
            "id": "WAR-2",
            "text": "## [WAR-2] ZentroMart Assured\nProducts marked `assured = true` in the catalog carry a 12-month ZentroMart Assured warranty from the delivery date, in addition to any brand warranty. Claims are raised in the app under My Orders, and ZentroMart arranges pickup and repair or replacement.",
            "file": "pol_warranty_assured.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-02-01",
            "version": "1.1",
            "title": "ZentroMart Assured"
          },
          {
            "id": "WAR-3",
            "text": "## [WAR-3] What warranty does not cover\nPhysical damage, liquid damage, normal wear and unauthorised repairs are not covered.",
            "file": "pol_warranty_assured.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-02-01",
            "version": "1.1",
            "title": "What warranty does not cover"
          },
          {
            "id": "products.csv:ELE-0012",
            "file": "data/products.csv",
            "text": "{\"sku\": \"ELE-0012\", \"title\": \"Kestrel K7 Smartphone 128 GB, Beige\", \"brand\": \"Kestrel\", \"return_category\": \"electronics\", \"price_inr\": \"17549\", \"fulfilled_by\": \"ZentroMart\", \"assured\": \"True\", \"warranty_months\": \"12\", \"description\": \"Kestrel K7 Smartphone 128 GB, Beige. Sold on ZentroMart.\"}",
            "doc_type": "catalog",
            "status": "current"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-1",
            "text": "## [RET-1] Scope\nThis policy covers items bought on ZentroMart, whether shipped by ZentroMart or by a marketplace seller. Seller-specific warranty terms are in the Marketplace sellers policy, but return windows are the same for every seller.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Scope"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-2",
            "text": "## [RET-2] Return windows by category\nThe return window starts on the **delivery date** and is counted in calendar days. The category of every product is listed in the `return_category` column of the product catalog.\n\n| Category | Return window | Catalog code |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Electronics and accessories | 7 days | `electronics` |\n| Clothing, footwear and bags | 15 days | `fashion` |\n| Home, kitchen and furniture | 10 days | `home_kitchen` |\n| Beauty and personal care (unopened, seal intact) | 7 days | `beauty_sealed` |\n| Books and stationery | 10 days | `books_media` |\n| Grocery, fresh and perishables | Not returnable | `grocery` |\n| Innerwear, lingerie and swimwear | Not returnable | `innerwear` |\n| Gift cards and digital codes | Not returnable | `digital` |",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Return windows by category"
          },
          {
            "id": "MKS-3",
            "text": "## [MKS-3] Warranty\nZentroMart Assured never applies to marketplace seller items, even if the listing says assured. Seller items carry only the brand warranty.",
            "file": "pol_marketplace_sellers.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-03-01",
            "version": "1.0",
            "title": "Warranty"
          },
          {
            "id": "DWM-4",
            "text": "## [DWM-4] Reported after 48 hours\nReports after 48 hours are handled as a normal return if the item is still within its return window. Otherwise the customer can use the brand or ZentroMart Assured warranty, if any.",
            "file": "pol_damaged_wrong_missing.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-05-01",
            "version": "1.3",
            "title": "Reported after 48 hours"
          },
          {
            "id": "MKS-1",
            "text": "## [MKS-1] Who ships your order\nEach product in the catalog has a `fulfilled_by` field. Items are either fulfilled by ZentroMart or by an independent marketplace seller.",
            "file": "pol_marketplace_sellers.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-03-01",
            "version": "1.0",
            "title": "Who ships your order"
          },
          {
            "id": "MKS-2",
            "text": "## [MKS-2] Returns and refunds\nReturn windows, reverse pickup and refunds are the same for every seller and are handled by ZentroMart.",
            "file": "pol_marketplace_sellers.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-03-01",
            "version": "1.0",
            "title": "Returns and refunds"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-3",
            "text": "## [RET-3] Change to electronics returns\nFrom **1 August 2026**, the return window for electronics and accessories is 7 days. Electronics **delivered before 1 August 2026** keep the earlier 10-day window from version 3 of this policy.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Change to electronics returns"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-4",
            "text": "## [RET-4] Condition of returned items\nItems must be unused, with original tags, packaging, accessories and free gifts. Beauty and personal care products are returnable only if unopened with the seal intact. Electronics must not be physically damaged, and any screen lock or account lock must be removed.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Condition of returned items"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-8",
            "text": "## [RET-8] Festive sale returns\nClothing, footwear and bags from orders **placed between 01 October and 15 October 2026** can be returned within 30 days of delivery. All other categories follow the normal windows in RET-2.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "Festive sale returns"
          },
          {
            "id": "REF-1",
            "text": "## [REF-1] When a refund is initiated\n- **Cancelled before shipping:** immediately on cancellation.\n- **Returned item:** after the item passes quality check, within 2 business days of pickup. ZentroMart Plus members: at pickup.\n- **Prepaid order refused at the door or not delivered after 3 attempts:** once the parcel reaches the warehouse, usually 7 to 10 calendar days after the last delivery attempt.",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "When a refund is initiated"
          },
          {
            "id": "DWM-3",
            "text": "## [DWM-3] High-value items\nClaims for items worth more than ₹10,000 are handled by the Priority Resolution team. The support agent must create a ticket and hand over; the agent cannot approve these claims.",
            "file": "pol_damaged_wrong_missing.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-05-01",
            "version": "1.3",
            "title": "High-value items"
          },
          {
            "id": "DEL-5",
            "text": "## [DEL-5] Where we deliver\nZentroMart delivers only within India, to pincodes listed as serviceable in the pincode table. Cash on delivery and Express are available only where the pincode table says so (`cod_available`, `express_available`). Not every metro pincode has Express.",
            "file": "pol_delivery_shipping.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-04-01",
            "version": "2.0",
            "title": "Where we deliver"
          }
        ],
